    {
      "id": "PSA.130.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.130.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Out of the depths have I cried unto thee, O Jehovah.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.130.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.130.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Lord, hear my voice:\nLet thine ears be attentive\nTo the voice of my supplications.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.130.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.130.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "If thou, Jehovah, shouldest mark iniquities,\nO Lord, who could stand?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.130.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.130.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But there is forgiveness with thee,\nThat thou mayest be feared.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.130.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.130.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I wait for Jehovah, my soul doth wait,\nAnd in his word do I hope.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.130.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.130.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "My soul ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "waiteth",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " for the Lord\nMore than watchmen ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "wait",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " for the morning;",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "Yea, more than",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " watchmen for the morning.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.130.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.130.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "O Israel, hope in Jehovah;\nFor with Jehovah there is lovingkindness,\nAnd with him is plenteous redemption.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.130.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.130.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And he will redeem Israel\nFrom all his iniquities.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    }
  ],
  "headings": [
    {
      "style": "s1",
      "text": "Hope in the Lord’s forgiving love.",
